Z||000014||JohnF||11-15-2001||06:29 PM||||Come to think of it, don't even bother to ask on this forum.  Use the telephone to get your LOCAL quote.  As you can see from all the responses so far (especially from Canada that has an entirely different rating system and currency to boot), dollars mean nothing to you where you live and drive.<P>We have from $2400+/yr CDN for something to $400/yr U.S. for something.  None of it makes a bit of difference to you.<P>Good luck!||||reg||1
Z||000015||Black86SE||11-15-2001||06:42 PM||||I am paying $36/month full coverage I believe. Actually now I am not paying anything cause it is in storage and they are not charging me. But it still has comprehensive. I am 20 with like 4 points, or 2 cause they haven't found out about the other 2. But I think I will be putting it back on full coverage cause my total insurance for my car and my '93 Chevy Silverado 4x4 is $133/month and with just my truck it is $155. WTF? Multi-car discount.||||reg||1
