Z||000018||Monkeyman||11-15-2001||07:03 PM||||Full coverage on my wifes '98 Cav (with gap coverage) and full coverage on my '86 GT.  We pay $165US/month through Progressive.  Both of us are in our mid 30s.  I have a squeaky clean record.  Ummm...My wife doesn't.  (She had a lead foot.)  Once all of her many points fall of, we can go to a cheaper insurance company (Progressive is actually considered a high risk company) and reduce our rates by about 1/2.||||reg||1
