Z||000024||Jaygee79||11-16-2001||01:03 AM||||I pay about $800 for either 10 months or 12 months (can't remember which one I have).  That includes the AAA discount and fire, theft, and glass.  Plus I'm only 22 and it's in my name.  The age thing factors in too.  And whether or not you had driver's ed, which I did.  They also factor in whether or not it's parked in a driveway or on the street, your driving record, etc.||||reg||1
